# Data Visualization and Storytelling

## Task Objective
The objective of this task is to create meaningful data visualizations and present insights using Power BI.

## Dataset
A sales dataset containing:
- Order ID
- Order Date
- Customer Name
- Gender
- Region
- Category
- Product
- Quantity
- Sales Amount
- Profit

## Dashboard Visualizations
The Power BI dashboard includes:

1. Total Sales – Card visualization
2. Sales by Category – Column Chart
3. Sales by Region – Pie Chart
4. Sales Trend Over Time – Line Chart

## Key Insights
- The dashboard provides an overview of overall sales performance.
- Sales can be compared across different product categories.
- Regional sales distribution can be easily analyzed.
- The sales trend helps identify changes in sales over time.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Microsoft Excel

## Conclusion
This project demonstrates how data visualization can transform raw sales data into meaningful business insights using interactive charts and dashboards.
